    "title": "Men's NCAA Tournament Final Four schedule, TV channel, streaming, more",
    "text": "March 29, 2026, 8:34 p.m. ETNo. 2 UConn shocked top-seeded Duke in the Elite Eight courtesy of true freshman Braylon Mullins' game-winning 3-pointer with less than a second left. The Huskies, who completed a 19-point comeback in the win, are back in the Final Four for the third time in four years.UConn will take on No. 3 Illinois in the first game in Indianapolis on Saturday, April 4, and the Fighting Illini have been impressive in the NCAA Tournament. On the other side of the bracket, it'll be a heavyweight battle of the two remaining No. 1 seeds in Arizona and Michigan.Arizona and Michigan bullied Purdue and Tennessee, respectively, in the Elite Eight, dominating their ways to double-digit victories.Here's everything to know of the Final Four, including how to watch and stream the remaining March Madness games:Stream the NCAA men's Final Four live with Sling TVWhich teams are in the Final Four 2026?No. 2 seed UConn (East Region)No. 3 seed Illinois (South Region)No. 1 seed Arizona (West Region)No. 1 seed Michigan (Midwest Region)Where is the Final Four in 2026?Location: Lucas Oil Stadium (Indianapolis)The men's Final Four in 2026 will be played at Lucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis, where the NFL's Indianapolis Colts play their home games.Final Four scheduleNote: Michigan-Arizona could be subject to change based on Illinois and UConn's conclusion.Saturday, April 4No. 3 Illinois vs. No. 2 UConn | 6:09 p.m. ETNo. 1 Michigan vs. No. 1 Arizona | 8:49 p.m. ETFinal Four TV channels, streamingTV channel: TBSStreaming: March Madness Live, Sling TVFinal Four games of the 2026 men's NCAA Tournament will air live on TBS, with streaming options on the March Madness Live app (with a TV provider login) or Sling TV.When is the men's college basketball national championship game?Date: Monday, April 6The men's NCAA Tournament national championship will take place on Monday, April 6, two days after the Final Four.Our team of savvy editors independently handpicks all recommendations. If you purchase through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.",
